# Options for cert-proxy-client
# Example:
# OPTS="-connect https://example.com:4433 -hook /etc/cert-proxy/hook -shared-hook /etc/cert-proxy/hook"
# OPTS="-connect https://cert-proxy.schlittermann.de -shared-hook /etc/cert-proxy/hook"
# Note: http:// implies port 443 of not given otherwise
# For defaults, see the output of `cert-proxy-client -h`
